OL,3,CWildfires: Five fire hazards in your
OL,4,Cgarden and how you can prevent them
OL,6,FPlant pathologist Pippa Greenwood told
OL,7,FITV News how people can adapt their
OL,8,Fgardening techniques to prevent risk
OL,9,Fof fire
OL,11,FThis year a total of 1,132 wildfires
OL,12,Fhave been recorded across England and
OL,13,FWales amid an exceptionally hot summer.
OL,15,FA recent fire in Stourbridge, West
OL,16,FMidlands destroyed and severely
OL,17,Fdamaged 40 homes, and on Friday a
OL,18,Fwildfire emergency alert was issued by
OL,19,Fthe government.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
