OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1787057312
OL,3,CWildfires: Five fire hazards in your
OL,4,Cgarden and how you can prevent them
OL,6,FHot temperatures and low rainfall have
OL,7,Fled to 71% of England and the whole of
OL,8,FWales declaring drought status. The UK
OL,9,Fhas experienced five heatwaves and
OL,10,Fseveral hosepipe bans have been issued
OL,11,Fby water companies.
OL,13,FDespite a temporary ban on disposable
OL,14,Fbarbeques, there are still other
OL,15,Ffactors that can increase the risk of
OL,16,Fwildfires, and they may be closer to
OL,17,Fhome than you think.
OL,19,FPippa Greenwood, a plant pathologist
OL,20,Fhas warned people to be cautious of
OL,21,Ffire hazards in their gardens.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1787057312
OL,3,CWildfires: Five fire hazards in your
OL,4,Cgarden and how you can prevent them
OL,6,FShe said: "I think it's easy to think,
OL,7,Foh, it won't be me. This one won't
OL,8,Fcount, it's small.
OL,10,F"But it can happen really, really
OL,11,Ffast, whether it's a barbecue or worse
OL,12,Fstill, a fire pit, a cigarette that
OL,13,Fyou don't put out properly or when
OL,14,Fyou're gardening."
OL,16,FSo, what are the main fire hazards in
OL,17,Fgardens and how can these risks be
OL,18,Fprevented?
OL,20,FPower tools
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1787057312
OL,3,CWildfires: Five fire hazards in your
OL,4,Cgarden and how you can prevent them
OL,6,FMs Greenwood told ITV News that
OL,7,Fsomething as simple as mowing a lawn
OL,8,Fcould pose a risk of fire.
OL,10,FShe said power tools such as lawnmower
OL,11,Fstrimmers, hedge cutters and chainsaws
OL,12,Fcause a tiny spark.
OL,14,FWhen this spark meets leaves and dead
OL,15,Ffoliage, it is "incredibly easy to
OL,16,Fignite and then to act as a good heat
OL,17,Fsource" she added.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1787057312
OL,3,CWildfires: Five fire hazards in your
OL,4,Cgarden and how you can prevent them
OL,6,F"If they're next to something like
OL,7,Fyour garden fence or shed, which is
OL,8,Fvery flammable, it's a kind of bridge
OL,9,Fas well. So they'll light really
OL,10,Fquickly with a tiny spark," Ms
OL,11,FGreenwood explained.
OL,13,FWest Yorkshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,14,Fsaid garden fires can spread through
OL,15,Ffencing and structures in minutes.
OL,16,FThis is due to them being made from
OL,17,Fwood which is a highly flammable
OL,18,Fmaterial.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
