SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1787057312
OL,3,CWildfires: Five fire hazards in your
OL,4,Cgarden and how you can prevent them
OL,6,FMs Greenwood also warned people to
OL,7,Fcheck that electrically powered tools
OL,8,Fare safe and not faulty to avoid
OL,9,Felectrocution and further risk of fire.
OL,11,FMirrors and glass
OL,13,FAnother danger is leaving mirrors or
OL,14,Fother glass in the garden. The glass
OL,15,Facts as a lens - when sunlight hits
OL,16,Fthe glass and bounces off onto another
OL,17,Fobject, it can cause the material to
OL,18,Fignite, starting a fire.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
