OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1787057312
OL,3,CWildfires: Five fire hazards in your
OL,4,Cgarden and how you can prevent them
OL,6,FMs Greenwood recalled how her friend's
OL,7,Fgarden had caught fire due to a
OL,8,Fdiscarded glass bottle that was hidden
OL,9,Fin the grass.
OL,11,FShe urged people to check for glass in
OL,12,Ftheir garden, particularly after
OL,13,Fdrinking alcohol, to avoid leaving
OL,14,Fbottles outside in the heat.
OL,16,F"So with something like a garden
OL,17,Fmirror, lovely as it is, either move
OL,18,Fit if it could be creating a hot spot,
OL,19,For cover it," she said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31808
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1787057312
OL,3,CWildfires: Five fire hazards in your
OL,4,Cgarden and how you can prevent them
OL,6,F"May not look that pretty, but it'll
OL,7,Fstop something really disastrous."
OL,9,FPlant debris
OL,11,FGarden material including dead leaves,
OL,12,Fdry grass and wood can be incredibly
OL,13,Fflammable.
OL,15,FTo prevent a fire, Ms Greenwood
OL,16,Fencourages gardeners to clear up the
OL,17,Fdebris when cutting plants, even when
OL,18,Fthey are growing slowly, so it is not
OL,19,Fleft to dry out in the heat.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
