PN,31809
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1787057312
OL,3,CWildfires: Five fire hazards in your
OL,4,Cgarden and how you can prevent them
OL,6,FShe also advised people to "take a few
OL,7,Fbuckets of water with you" when
OL,8,Fstrimming because "if a tiny fire
OL,9,Fstarts, you can put it out before you
OL,10,Fthen go and get something stronger
OL,11,Fonto it."
OL,13,FLondon Fire Brigade (LFB) lists these
OL,14,Fways to prevent garden fires:
OL,16,FCompost heaps
OL,18,FCompost heaps can be dangerous because
OL,19,Fthey trap heat.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31810
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1787057312
OL,3,CWildfires: Five fire hazards in your
OL,4,Cgarden and how you can prevent them
OL,6,FAs the temperature increases rapidly
OL,7,Fin the centre, the compost heap may
OL,8,Fspontaneously combust, starting a fire.
OL,10,FTo prevent this, Ms Greenwood said
OL,11,Fgardeners should keep turning the
OL,12,Fcompost to allow the heat to escape,
OL,13,Fand "keep it moist and then it doesn't
OL,14,Fget that really intense, intense heat
OL,15,Fin the centre."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31811
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1787057312
OL,3,CWildfires: Five fire hazards in your
OL,4,Cgarden and how you can prevent them
OL,6,FThe LFB advised people to keep compost
OL,7,Fheaps away from buildings to prevent
OL,8,Ffires and keep a balance of green
OL,9,Fmaterials (food waste and fresh garden
OL,10,Fwaste) and brown materials (dry
OL,11,Fleaves, straw etc).
OL,13,FThe government issued a temporary ban
OL,14,Fon the sale of disposable barbeques,
OL,15,Fbut other barbeques can also pose a
OL,16,Fserious risk of fire.
OL,18,FA popular summer social activity,
OL,19,Femergency services have urged the
OL,20,Fpublic to be extra cautious when
OL,21,Fburning anything in their garden.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31812
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1787057312
OL,3,CWildfires: Five fire hazards in your
OL,4,Cgarden and how you can prevent them
OL,6,FWest Yorkshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,7,Fsaid lit barbeques should never be
OL,8,Fleft unattended and they must be
OL,9,Fplaced on a "flat, stable surface,
OL,10,Fwell away from buildings, fences,
OL,11,Fshrubs, sheds and waste".
OL,13,FThe fire service also said BBQs and
OL,14,Fashes should not be moved until they
OL,15,Fhave cooled fully and only use fuels
OL,16,Fand firelighters designed for BBQs -
OL,17,Fnever use petrol.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31813
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1787057312
OL,3,CWildfires: Five fire hazards in your
OL,4,Cgarden and how you can prevent them
OL,6,FDo not put hot ashes in a bin as this
OL,7,Fcan also cause a fire and only use
OL,8,Fenough charcoal to cover the base of
OL,9,Fthe barbeque.
OL,11,FPippa Greenwood said Brits must adapt
OL,12,Fto the risks of hot, dry weather.
OL,14,F"These are situations we're just not
OL,15,Fused to living in. So it's about
OL,16,Fgetting our heads around exactly what
OL,17,Fthose dangers are and just not taking
OL,18,Fany risks," she said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
