FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31814
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1787057312
OL,3,CWildfires: Five fire hazards in your
OL,4,Cgarden and how you can prevent them
OL,6,FThe good news is rain is on the way
OL,7,Fwith the Met Office forecasting
OL,8,F"changeable" and "cooler" conditions.
OL,10,FHowever a yellow heat alert remains in
OL,11,Fplace until Tuesday for South East,
OL,12,FSouth West, and London, meaning
OL,13,Fgardeners should still be cautious of
OL,14,Fthe risks of wildfires.
OL,16,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,17,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,18,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,19,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/14
